gest formation of the Finnish Army during the Winter War. The 5th Division's primary deployment was along the Mannerheim Line, a defensive system of fortifications against the Soviet Union that was positioned between Lake Muolaanjärvi and Kuolemajärvi. The  Army of the Isthmus managed to halt the Soviet advance for two months, but finally the Soviet forces pierced the Mannerheim Line, and the rest of the Finnish defenses fell in turn.","LocalizedString":"The 13th Infantry Regiment was a unit of the 5th Division of the Finnish Army during the Winter War. This division was part of the II Corps (II AK), and along with the III Corps (III AK), it formed the Army of the Isthmus, which was the largest formation of the Finnish Army during the Winter War. The 5th Division's primary deployment was along the Mannerheim Line, a defensive system of fortifications against the Soviet Union that was positioned between Lake Muolaanjärvi and Kuolemajärvi. The  Army of the Isthmus managed to halt the Soviet advance for two months, but finally the Soviet forces pierced the Mannerheim Line, and the rest of the Finnish defenses fell in turn."},"operationCost":1,"rarity":"ERarityEnum::Common","cardSet":"ECardSetEnum::WinterWar","isInPermanentPool":true,"extraHelpTextBubbleTypes":["EHelpBubbleTypes::Deployment","EHelpBubbleTypes::Guard"],"hasDeployment":true,"hasGuard":true,"Image":{"AssetPathName":"/Game/Assets/Textures/Images/Finland/t_fin_inf_test.t_fin_inf_test","SubPathString":""},"artist":"David Pentland","historyPhoto":{"AssetPathName":"/Game/Assets/Textures/HistoricalPhotos/INFANTRY_REGIMENT_13.INFANTRY_REGIMENT_13","SubPathString":""},"historyPhotoSize":{"X":512.0,"Y":366.0},"historyPhotoDescription":{"Namespace":"card_finland","Key":"card_unit_infantry_regiment_13_photo","SourceString":"Finnish infantry defending in a trench of the Mannerheim Line between 1939 and 1940.","LocalizedString":"Finnish infantry defending in a trench of the Mannerheim Line between 1939 and 1940."},"blo